  description: '2 Level 2 monsters

    For this card''s Xyz Summon, you can treat
    Link-2 monsters you control as Level 2 monsters for material. The original ATK
    of this card that has a Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster as material becomes
    doubled. During your Main Phase: You can activate this effect; detach 1 material
    from a monster you control, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Level 2 monster from
    your Deck, also neither player can Special Summon for the rest of this turn,
    except Level/Rank/Link 2 monsters. You can only use this effect of "Gigantic
    Spright" once per turn.'
